    {
      "name": "Login with email, password, optional MFA & device fingerprint",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "auth",
            "login"
          ],
          "variable": []
        },
        "description": "Authenticates the user and issues:\n- an **accessToken** (JWT, 15 min)\n- a **refreshToken** (rotating, bound to the device fingerprint)\n\n**Two-Factor Authentication (2FA)**  \n• If user has 2FA enabled, `mfaToken` is required  \n• Without `mfaToken`, returns `206` status requesting 2FA code  \n• With valid `mfaToken`, completes login normally  \n\n**Fields**  \n• `email`: your registered email  \n• `password`: your account password  \n• `mfaToken`: 6-digit code from authenticator app (required if 2FA enabled)  \n• `deviceFingerprint`: a unique string identifying this device  \n"
      }
    },
