          "path": [
            "api",
            "auth",
            "magic-link"
          ],
          "variable": []
        },
        "description": "Sends a one-time magic link to the given email address.  \n- **Sign-in** (existing user): `email` + `deviceFingerprint` required.  \n- **Sign-up** (new user): `fullName` & `role` also required.  \n- Link expires in 10m, must be opened from same IP/browser.  \n- Always returns `200 OK` to prevent email enumeration.\n"
      }
    },
