        "description": "Returns a JSON payload containing the URL you must navigate to in your browser\nto start Google OAuth2. You **must** supply:\n- `role`: Desired user role for new sign-ups  \n- `deviceFingerprint`: Client’s device fingerprint for session binding\n"
