          "path": [
            "auth",
            "mfa",
            "setup"
          ],
          "variable": []
        },
        "description": "Generates a new TOTP secret and QR code for setting up two-factor authentication.\n\n**Response includes:**\n- QR code as data URL for easy scanning\n- Manual entry key for manual setup\n- Secret for verification\n- Backup codes for account recovery\n\n**Important:** Save the backup codes securely before enabling MFA!\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Enable MFA with verification code",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/mfa/enable",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "auth",
            "mfa",
            "enable"
          ],
          "variable": []
        },
        "description": "Enables two-factor authentication after verifying the setup with a test code.\n\n**Steps:**\n1. Call `/auth/mfa/setup` to get QR code and secret\n2. Scan QR code with authenticator app\n3. Generate 6-digit code from app\n4. Call this endpoint with code and secret to enable MFA\n\n**Security:** Once enabled, all future logins will require the 6-digit code.\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Disable MFA with verification code",
